{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/0e9022a65d21f910988032e314299eda.poster.avif?t=1774448948\" width=770 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/0e9022a65d21f910988032e314299eda.webm?t=1774448948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/0e9022a65d21f910988032e314299eda.mp4?t=1774448948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Foundlings</i></strong><strong> is a story-driven RPG revolving around a journey of maturing, self-discovery and forgiveness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking cues from classic SNES RPGs and adding a pinch of branching dialogue and character building, <i>Foundlings</i> seeks to explore new and exciting ways of crafting an RPG experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/5d360e7f8779a0ab6670f2e3c6cc03e1.avif?t=1774448948\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After getting arrested on the same night due to performing unsanctioned magical acts, young healer's apprentice <strong>Agnes</strong> and remorseful ex-executioner <strong>Frant</strong> are brought together by the whim of a local feudal lord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are tasked with <i>tracking down the head of a deviant mages' guild</i>, whom they suspect to be responsible for the recent unrest among both the local wildlife and the inhabitants of the surrounding villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/13bf918db5168c5187dc8c62a4759a10.webp?t=1774448948\" width=60 height=76 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/71fe175862701a8b4e1e9d0457ed2856.avif?t=1774448948\" width=74 height=76 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Ravaged Medieval Land</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a war-torn 12th-century England filled with mystical forests, forgotten battlefields, and ancient burial grounds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Heartfelt Tale of Hardship</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide two outcast mages during the Revolt of 1173. Every choice shapes life, death, and redemption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living Narrative World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet nobles, peasants, scholars, and fellow outcasts. Shape your relationships through choices, knowing that not every outcome is yours to decide.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/9bf9e494d0db1af01a31164263c4857b.avif?t=1774448948\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/e9c58f12c5104e78652eb146377ce856.poster.avif?t=1774448948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/e9c58f12c5104e78652eb146377ce856.webm?t=1774448948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/e9c58f12c5104e78652eb146377ce856.mp4?t=1774448948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Spellcasting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience tactical planning with real-time spell execution using conduits, scrolls, and potions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Character Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between Agnes and Frant, each with evolving behaviors and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Novice to Initiate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study medieval disciplines, practice alchemy, acquire conduits, and craft new spells to build your personal spellbook.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Four Humours</strong>\u00a0<strong>System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance blood, phlegm, yellow bile and black bile to stabilize your emotions in combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Celestial Influence</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Align spells with planetary movements to enhance their effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paths to Mastery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study liberal arts like Rhetoric and Theology, and delve into true-to-life alchemy and occult practices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/9c99d53669be4872d7756de90bf6504c.poster.avif?t=1774448948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/9c99d53669be4872d7756de90bf6504c.webm?t=1774448948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/9c99d53669be4872d7756de90bf6504c.mp4?t=1774448948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A touching, character-driven story</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical positioning and resource management meet real-time spellcasting action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization via dialogue and combat choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching dialogue paths &amp; stat-based skill checks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies visible within the game's levels, without random encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique stats and resources based on historical science and philosophy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration that reveals the mysterious forces governing the medieval world</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ spells, scrolls and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ alternate endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16-bit pixel aesthetics + illustrations inspired by medieval European art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack blending progressive rock, SNES-era game music &amp; Balkan/Middle Eastern folk</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3784610?t=1774448948","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/e2b586135c10ddfc1f437b078fa47ea395b8aff4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774448948","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/d3174a881796b025e1deb8ab3a4bd595c689d979/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774448948","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/d3174a881796b025e1deb8ab3a4bd595c689d979/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774448948","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains foul language, mild violence, themes of psychological abuse and social ostracization, several disturbing scenes and images of blood, dismemberment, corpses and corrupted/zombified flesh."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/0e9022a65d21f910988032e314299eda.poster.avif?t=1774448948\" width=770 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/0e9022a65d21f910988032e314299eda.webm?t=1774448948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/0e9022a65d21f910988032e314299eda.mp4?t=1774448948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Foundlings</i></strong><strong> is a story-driven RPG revolving around a journey of maturing, self-discovery and forgiveness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking cues from classic SNES RPGs and adding a pinch of branching dialogue and character building, <i>Foundlings</i> seeks to explore new and exciting ways of crafting an RPG experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/5d360e7f8779a0ab6670f2e3c6cc03e1.avif?t=1774448948\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After getting arrested on the same night due to performing unsanctioned magical acts, young healer's apprentice <strong>Agnes</strong> and remorseful ex-executioner <strong>Frant</strong> are brought together by the whim of a local feudal lord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are tasked with <i>tracking down the head of a deviant mages' guild</i>, whom they suspect to be responsible for the recent unrest among both the local wildlife and the inhabitants of the surrounding villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src