p4?t=1774448948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Spellcasting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience tactical planning with real-time spell execution using conduits, scrolls, and potions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Character Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between Agnes and Frant, each with evolving behaviors and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Novice to Initiate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study medieval disciplines, practice alchemy, acquire conduits, and craft new spells to build your personal spellbook.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Four Humours</strong>\u00a0<strong>System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance blood, phlegm, yellow bile and black bile to stabilize your emotions in combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Celestial Influence</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Align spells with planetary movements to enhance their effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paths to Mastery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study liberal arts like Rhetoric and Theology, and delve into true-to-life alchemy and occult practices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/9c99d53669be4872d7756de90bf6504c.poster.avif?t=1774448948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/9c99d53669be4872d7756de90bf6504c.webm?t=1774448948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/extras/9c99d53669be4872d7756de90bf6504c.mp4?t=1774448948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A touching, character-driven story</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical positioning and resource management meet real-time spellcasting action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization via dialogue and combat choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching dialogue paths &amp; stat-based skill checks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies visible within the game's levels, without random encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique stats and resources based on historical science and philosophy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration that reveals the mysterious forces governing the medieval world</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ spells, scrolls and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ alternate endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16-bit pixel aesthetics + illustrations inspired by medieval European art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack blending progressive rock, SNES-era game music &amp; Balkan/Middle Eastern folk</p></li></ul>","developers":["Maypole Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784610/b189407f298cac44aa0a05cb895956c2ea22b79d/header.jpg?t=1774448948","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784610/1595657129/cc7afc44e057c4fd32199e7091e8455dc1d87860/1774442001/dash_av1.mpd?t=1774448946","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784610/1595657129/cc7afc44e057c4fd32199e7091e8455dc1d87860/1774442001/dash_h264.mpd?t=1774448946","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784610/1595657129/cc7afc44e05